    {
      "uid": "zhcn:139e776d74a8cd8d5967db81",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这并非是逃避的转生，而是作为势在必得的旅途，\n为了获得至高无上的光芒，而发起的挑战――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "456b015b1a6316177e8e9af1a1f0db5b7a10a2c09f10140b64d1eafe397f64d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
