    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0633d6eaad10ffa920d5c742",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然决定了，那就必须定下接下来的目标。\n趁着夏日合宿的空档，\n先去试试水，看看目前的状态应该会比较好吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e3e99c99af9b9fe6fad23ae2260a5ec258a9dfe39a395a941864238011060e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
