      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唯有您，才配称作与我休戚与共的人。\n请务必……在未来的日子里，也与我同在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d47a0264632467d07473b3d05db5a5980f0faa69c398f8100fa5cd7431a5c4d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
