    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7fdf0502216633399a60d44",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是由两人共同选下的荆棘之路。\n但在这条路的尽头，定然有着超越所有人想象的\n『异世界』在等待着他们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d41c2a11b9c6497aa951650fd39f48c434031a78d16c6d420d8516b2f97937d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caf74b41372195c2e88522cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比任何人，都更想亲眼见证她未来的――是我",
      "source_fingerprint": "f464e32bae48f1016b91c43875104af51feb84296e880c80dbc43518cb92871f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
