      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一想到红色梦想的职业生涯可能就在这里戛然而止，\n我无论如何也无法接受。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14913e130e600c5d3f7fe807581602c42e160fb0a72db4a90752a6ca9cc32462",
